# Placement of bluse2_v26.sm2d (test blouse v26, stage 4d)
#
# Part | zone | anchor point | circumference | height | options
# Circumference on torso and neck in degrees from the top: 0 front, 90 left, 180 back, 270 right
# (wearer's sides), with "cm" as arc length; on the arm: 0 top, 90 front. Height in cm, from the
# side neck point. Pattern y runs downwards, the placement turns it upright.
#
# V01-V16 from `klon3d lage` (the 16 sewn pieces of the proposal). Added by hand, because the
# proposal cannot place them: the plunge trim and the two collar layers. The 9 decorative discs
# are not sewn on purpose (see the seam list) and are left off.
#
# Front pieces hang on VN (side neck point, 8.2 cm beside the centre front; VN lies at the side
# neck point of the body). VK0 is 7.30 cm lower and 1.77 cm beside the centre front - that is the
# anchor of the trim. The collar hangs on KHM (centre of the band, back centre) as in bluse3_v2;
# the outer layer starts 6 mm further out so the two layers do not begin in the same place.

abstand 2

